From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Anthony Falabella <falabellamichael@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 15:30:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add device-hosted account images to the client SDK

AccountAvatarClient signs v2 image references, keeps a bounded local cache and transfers images between authorized devices over the encrypted mesh. The C API exposes ln_account_avatar_configure, ln_account_avatar_sign and the get/put calls. It needs the companion reference API on the Nexus server.
